Actually, to be _extremely_ pedantic, ours just captures all the NetHack
program output and dumps it to a file.  Thus, it'll display properly on any
terminal set with the same options the player had been using.  So it works
equally well on ANSI, VT* and any other supported terminal types.  It'll even
handle DEC/IBMgraphics modes, provided the playback terminal is set up for them.

Matt suggested that for next year we switch to
<http://nh-recorder.sourceforge.net/>.  He's fiddled with it a bit and thinks
it does all the one I wrote a few years ago for the Tournament does and better.
